### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 85/100.** Evidence DeepSWE 65.9% ; CursorBench 69.9% ; AA Index 61; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 84/100.** Evidence GPQA ~84% ; HLE ~30%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 82/100.** 500,000 — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 70/100.** Text and image in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 82/100.** Evidence LiveCodeBench 88.22% #7 ; SWE ~60%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 60/100.** Paid $2/$6 per 1M (Fast $4/$12).
- **Overall Score: 81/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (85+84+82+70+82)/5=80.6 → 81; best-fit per scoring methodology.

